.TH ASPEN-SYNC-MODULES 8 "" "aspen-discovery" "Aspen Discovery"
.SH NAME
aspen-sync-modules \- align a site's module units with its database
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aspen-sync-modules
.I site
|
.B \-\-all
.SH DESCRIPTION
Queries the site's database for the enabled modules with a background
process and enables or disables the matching aspen-<module>@<site>
units. Warns about enabled modules that have no unit, and changes
nothing when the database is unreachable.
.PP
Run automatically when the site target starts, every five minutes by
aspen-sync-modules@<site>.timer, and immediately by a path unit when
the admin UI touches
.IR /data/aspen-discovery/<site>/module_change.flag .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aspen-svc (8)
